A temple is a room (or other defined area) with an altar that at one
time, at least nominally, had an attendant priest.

("At least nominally" since some special levels have temples that are
already abandoned.)

The Temple of Coeus, the Isle of Glass, and the Temple of Nalzok
(Healer, Knight, and Priest Quest locate levels respectively) are the
only possible temples in the game to have a staircase within their
precincts, I believe.

